<description>&lt;p&gt;Israeli soldiers have demolished several houses in southern Lebanon and then pulled back, allowing Lebanese villagers to return to wrecked homes. Lebanese President Aoun has demanded Israel withdraw and warned Iran to stop interfering in Lebanon. The Lebanese army arrested three people accused of smuggling explosives from Syria, and the IDF spokesperson’s visit to a Lebanese school sparked outrage. IDF intelligence warned that an Israeli strike on Iran could trigger a multifront war. The conflict caused 4,335 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxNSURNTGg4WlU3TElmSGlVQVl6YXc2aEVPaGIyNlE0N05EZGMycmEyOGJWSXJ6VklYV2dEVHFuQUxHRmQyUldCWVROQmhDVVlNSzhYdGJSOGdMT1NlWDlpb0ViVUdQZVdZdmsyTEJpTWlMM1haZ2F5Vm8xc2pZblNia2pFLXJ5Z3RNa2kzc1NqeHpjSE8xeWJwQ05zeVBnMUZoYy1DSm54ZDZFS0NRcDZKc2FoT3ppSWdhenc?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxORll3ZkNWTTRuZ19vOTViOVlJZXlXczJUa0ZOWmN6M3JSVVlQbmhhZ0FsTTFrQUE4VDhDbjV6cGNyTVNOSnZxTUF2Z1p2NmE0MmhweGlLelliRnY2RkhUalpwWTgybUdsYWljc200MmFoWEFlbF9JWUJGZXBlREdJdTg3Q1Etdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;NPR&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxOVmF4dmxfdm9CQml4RExHbVgtSU5JZXZWcVRqbXItRFBublBkcHo0aGNQM0wtX05XeEZ2QVJfaVREeEJuVXBHX3U0TW11cEQ0dmlDSkthNGtIRmdnUFJ0UHRTRm9OT0JoQ2d4Q0N2cjVqUDlsZUVJZ1lDbXVPdnZmcllNOHRkcmZZaTFQVXdmZFVVdGd2eTFOSnZBMG1naTZKUnRGZ01sbTJPdEpYNEN4TTllQmJmaDlj0gG-AUFVX3lxTFBMVlpmMDUyNzl2SDhHcms1b2lYOGoyUGZuLTlZZm4zZGd2d2NPaWdxLUdXV1hLYTVRODdNU2hSRjE0MFAyZzB4bngwNk14THo3bEJiVjRqNnBWTmQxNlMzeFdmLTJvRkdpZTgzVXRMRWN5VC1iZnRYWjlMWlJFSXJFVldiSHVJYkxaSS1ITmZ6